# Job Application Tracker API Documentation

## Base URL

```http
http://localhost:5000/api
```

## Authentication

Protected routes require a JWT token.

Example:

```http
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN
```

## Register User

### Endpoint

```http
POST /auth/register
```

### Request Body

```json
{
  "name": "Aditya",
  "email": "aditya@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}
```

### Success Response

```json
{
  "message": "User created successfully",
  "user": {
    "_id": "user_id",
    "name": "Aditya",
    "email": "aditya@example.com"
  }
}
```

## Login User

### Endpoint

```http
POST /auth/login
```

### Request Body

```json
{
  "email": "aditya@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}
```

### Success Response

```json
{
  "message": "Login successfully",
  "token": "JWT_TOKEN"
}
```

## Get User Profile

### Endpoint

```http
GET /auth/profile
```

### Headers

```http
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN
```

### Success Response

```json
{
  "_id": "user_id",
