## Create Job

### Endpoint

```http
POST /jobs
```

### Headers

```http
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN
```

### Request Body

```json
{
  "company": "Google",
  "position": "Frontend Developer",
  "status": "Applied"
}
```

### Success Response

```json
{
  "_id": "job_id",
  "company": "Google",
  "position": "Frontend Developer",
  "status": "Applied"
}
```

---

