## Search Jobs

### Endpoint

```http
GET /jobs?search=google
```

### Description

Search jobs by company name or position.

---

## Filter Jobs

### Endpoint

```http
GET /jobs?status=Interview
```

### Description

Filter jobs by status.

Available statuses:

- Applied
- Interview
- Rejected
- Offer

---

## Pagination

### Endpoint

```http
GET /jobs?page=1&limit=5
```

### Description

Get jobs page by page.

---

## Sorting

### Latest First

```http
GET /jobs?sort=latest
```

### Oldest First

```http
GET /jobs?sort=oldest
```

### Company A-Z

```http
GET /jobs?sort=a-z
```

### Company Z-A

```http
GET /jobs?sort=z-a
```

